cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "macroitems: the LP relaxation of the precedence-constrained knapsack problem through parametric maximum closure"
abstract: >-
  Computes the canonical macroitem sequence of a precedence-constrained
  knapsack instance -- the increments of the nested path of maximal optimal
  closures, with strictly decreasing profit-to-weight ratios -- and with it
  the whole value function of the LP relaxation, the solution at any capacity,
  the canonical dual certificate, reduced costs over the dual optimal face,
  and the dimensions of the optimal faces.
message: "If you use this software, please cite it and the companion papers."
